#: woocommerce-for-japan.php:56
msgid "Update PHP now: critical security vulnerabilities"
msgstr "PHP の重大な脆弱性: 今すぐ更新してください"

#. translators: 1: PHP version of this site, 2: first fixed PHP version, 3: vulnerability IDs
#: woocommerce-for-japan.php:58
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The PHP version of this site (%1$s) has critical vulnerabilities (%3$s) that "
"let an attacker run code on the server with a single request. Update PHP to "
"%2$s or later right away."
msgstr ""
"このサイトの PHP（%1$s）には、1 回のリクエストでサーバー上のコードを実行され"
"る重大な脆弱性（%3$s）があります。修正版（%2$s）以上へすぐ更新してください。"

#: woocommerce-for-japan.php:59
msgid ""
"Security support for PHP 8.2 ends at the end of 2026, so we recommend "
"updating to PHP 8.3 or later."
msgstr ""
"PHP 8.2 は 2026 年末でサポートが終わるため、PHP 8.3 以上への更新をおすすめし"
"ます。"

#: woocommerce-for-japan.php:60
msgid ""
"Your hosting company may have applied the fix without changing the PHP "
"version number. Please check with your hosting company."
msgstr ""
"サーバー会社が個別に修正を当てている場合があります（PHP のバージョン番号は変"
"わりません）。サーバー会社に確認してください。"

#. translators: 1: PHP version of this site, 2: vulnerability IDs
#: woocommerce-for-japan.php:62
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The PHP version of this site (%1$s) has critical vulnerabilities (%2$s). "
"Official support for this PHP version has ended, and no fixed version has "
"been released for it. Some hosting companies apply their own security "
"patches, but update to PHP 8.3 or later, which is supported longer, as soon "
"as possible."
msgstr ""
"このサイトの PHP（%1$s）には重大な脆弱性（%2$s）があります。この PHP の公式サ"
"ポートは終了しており、修正版は出ていません。レンタルサーバーなどでは個別にセ"
"キュリティパッチを当てている場合がありますが、サポート期間が長い PHP 8.3 以上"
"へ早急に更新してください。"

#. translators: 1: PHP version of this site, 2: first fixed PHP version, 3: vulnerability IDs
#: woocommerce-for-japan.php:64
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This site runs a pre-release of PHP (%1$s) that has critical vulnerabilities "
"(%3$s). Update it to %2$s or later."
msgstr ""
"このサイトの PHP（%1$s）は開発版で、重大な脆弱性（%3$s）があります。%2$s 以降"
"へ更新してください。"

#: woocommerce-for-japan.php:65
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "詳しくはこちら"

#: woocommerce-for-japan.php:66
msgid "Don't show again"
msgstr "今後表示しない"

#: woocommerce-for-japan.php:67
msgid "Close"
msgstr "閉じる"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s are HTML tags for a link that wraps around the five-star rating. %1$s opens the link and %2$s closes it. The &#9733; characters represent star symbols that will be displayed in the rating.
#: class-jp4wc.php:238
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you like <strong>Japanized for WooCommerce</strong> please leave us a "
"%1$s&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;%2$s rating. A huge thanks in advance!"
msgstr ""
"もし、<strong>Japanized for WooCommerce</strong> を気に入って頂けたら%1$s "
"&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; %2$s 評価してもらえたら、とても嬉しいで"
"す !"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s are HTML tags for a link that wraps around the five-star rating. %1$s opens the link and %2$s closes it. The &#9733; characters represent star symbols that will be displayed in the rating.
#: class-jp4wc.php:238
msgid "Thanks :)"
msgstr "ありがとうございます :)"

