msgstr "ウィザードを使用せず、手動で情報を入力する。"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:16
msgid "Application flow"
msgstr "申し込みフロー"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:20
msgid ""
"Please fill in all the fields on this application screen and click the "
"\"Agree to the above and apply\" button at the bottom of the screen."
msgstr ""
"本申込み画面の項目を全て記入し、画面下の「上記へ同意して申込み」ボタンをク"
"リックしてください。"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:26
msgid ""
"Paidy Co., Ltd. will review your application information and may take up to "
"5 business days."
msgstr ""
"申込情報をもとに株式会社Paidyにて加盟店審査を行います。最大5営業日かかること"
"がございます。"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:32
msgid "The results will be notified via email and dashboard."
msgstr "審査結果はメールおよびダッシュボードにて通知いたします。"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:38
msgid ""
"If your application is approved, you will be able to activate Paidy from "
"your dashboard."
msgstr "審査承認時は、ダッシュボードからペイディを有効化できます。"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:43
msgid "If your application is rejected, you will not be able to use Paidy."
msgstr "審査否決時は、ペイディをご利用いただくことはできません。"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:58
