msgstr "加盟店情報の取扱いに関する同意条項"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:84
msgid ""
"Add the notation specified by our company to the notation based on the "
