#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:93
msgid "Display sample based on the Specified Commercial Transactions Act"
msgstr "特商法に基づく表示サンプル"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:100
msgid "Add the specified notation to the privacy policy page."
msgstr "プライバシーポリシーページに弊社所定の表記を追加すること。"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:109
msgid "Example of a privacy policy"
msgstr "プライバシーポリシーの記入例"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:116
msgid ""
"Paidy Inc. will set up the API key on your e-commerce site via WooCommerce "
"on your behalf."
msgstr ""
"株式会社 Paidy が、WooCommerce を介して貴社に代わり、EC サイトへ API キーの設"
"定を行うこと。"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/main-hooks/form-info.jsx:122
msgid ""
"Our company (Shokunin Kobo LLC) will provide personal information to third "
"parties when disclosing such information for purposes such as member store "
"screening by payment companies."
msgstr ""
"当社（職人工房　合同会社）は、決済会社での加盟店審査等のために個人情報を開示"
"する場合に、個人情報を第三者に提供いたします。"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/wizard/components/controls.jsx:101
#: src/js/paidy/wizard/components/controls.jsx:118
msgid "Please enter in full-width katakana."
msgstr "全角カタカナで入力してください。"

#: assets/js/build/paidy/wizard/paidy.js:1
#: src/js/paidy/wizard/components/controls.jsx:135
