#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:165
msgid "Japanized for WooCommerce security check"
msgstr "Japanized for WooCommerce セキュリティチェック"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:171
msgid ""
"The vulnerability data has not been updated for a while, so vulnerabilities "
"disclosed since then are not checked."
msgstr ""
"脆弱性データがしばらく更新されていないため、それ以降に公開された脆弱性は照合"
"されていません。"

#. translators: %d: number of vulnerabilities
#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:189
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d known vulnerability was found in the software installed on this site."
msgid_plural ""
"%d known vulnerabilities were found in the software installed on this site."
msgstr[0] ""
"このサイトにインストールされているソフトウェアに、既知の脆弱性が %d 件見つか"
"りました。"

#. translators: %s: host name of the vulnerability feed, e.g. wc.artws.info
#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:192
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The vulnerability data could not be downloaded, so the installed plugins, "
"themes and WordPress are not being checked. Make sure this server can "
"connect to %s, or turn the vulnerability check off in the JP4WC settings."
msgstr ""
"脆弱性データを取得できないため、インストール済みのプラグイン・テーマ・"
"WordPress を照合できていません。このサーバーから %s に接続できるか確かめる"
"か、JP4WC の設定で脆弱性チェックを無効にしてください。"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:198
msgid ""
"Update the affected plugins, themes or WordPress to a fixed version, or "
"remove the ones that have no fix."
msgstr ""
"該当するプラグイン・テーマ・WordPress を修正済みのバージョンに更新するか、修"
"正版の無いものは削除してください。"

#. translators: %d: number of vulnerabilities not listed
#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:235
#, php-format
msgid "and %d more"
msgid_plural "and %d more"
msgstr[0] "ほか %d 件"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:252
msgctxt "vulnerability severity"
msgid "Critical"
msgstr "緊急"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:253
msgctxt "vulnerability severity"
msgid "High"
msgstr "高"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:254
msgctxt "vulnerability severity"
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "中"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:255
msgctxt "vulnerability severity"
msgid "Low"
msgstr "低"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:256
msgctxt "vulnerability severity"
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

#. translators: %s: severity of a vulnerability, e.g. High
#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:260
#, php-format
msgid "Severity: %s"
msgstr "深刻度: %s"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:264
msgid "No fixed version yet"
msgstr "修正版はまだありません"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated versions that fix the vulnerability
#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:267
#, php-format
msgid "Fixed in %s"
msgstr "修正版: %s"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:311
msgid "License"
msgstr "ライセンス"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:330
msgid "Open the Security tab"
msgstr "セキュリティタブを開く"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-api.php:85
msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to view the security check."
msgstr "セキュリティチェックを表示する権限がありません。"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-api.php:106
msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to run the security check."
msgstr "セキュリティチェックを実行する権限がありません。"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-api.php:114
msgid "The page has expired. Reload it and try again."
msgstr ""
"ページの有効期限が切れました。再読み込みしてからもう一度お試しください。"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-api.php:141
msgid "The security check is off."
msgstr "セキュリティチェックはオフです。"

#. translators: %d: seconds to wait
#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-api.php:152
#, php-format
msgid "A re-check was asked for a moment ago. Try again in %d second."
msgid_plural "A re-check was asked for a moment ago. Try again in %d seconds."
msgstr[0] "少し前に再チェックを依頼しました。%d 秒後にもう一度お試しください。"

#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-api.php:166
msgid "The re-check could not be scheduled in WP-Cron. Try again later."
msgstr ""
"再チェックを WP-Cron に予約できませんでした。しばらくしてからもう一度お試しく"
"ださい。"

#. translators: %d: minutes until logins are accepted again
#: includes/class-jp4wc-login-limiter.php:181
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Error:</strong> Too many login attempts. Please try again in %d "
"minute."
msgid_plural ""
"<strong>Error:</strong> Too many login attempts. Please try again in %d "
"minutes."
msgstr[0] ""
"<strong>エラー:</strong> ログインの試行回数が多すぎます。%d 分後にやり直して"
"ください。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-xmlrpc-guard.php:272
msgid "XML-RPC services are disabled on this site."
msgstr "このサイトでは XML-RPC サービスが無効になっています。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:630
msgid "Agree to the terms of use and the privacy policy to run the check."
msgstr "診断するには、利用規約とプライバシーポリシーに同意してください。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:654
msgid ""
"The Terms of Use and the Privacy Policy of the free check changed after this "
"page was opened. Reload the page, read them and agree again."
msgstr ""
"このページを開いた後に、無料診断の利用規約とプライバシーポリシーが変わりまし"
"た。ページを再読み込みし、内容を確認して改めて同意してください。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:737
msgid ""
"The check data was deleted while the check ran, so its result was not kept."
msgstr "診断の実行中に診断データが削除されたため、結果は保存しませんでした。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:860
msgid ""
"This site cannot be checked: its address or a version of WordPress, "
"WooCommerce, PHP or this plugin cannot be sent as the check requires."
msgstr ""
"このサイトは診断できません。サイトのアドレス、または WordPress・WooCommerce・"
"PHP・このプラグインのバージョンを、診断に必要な形で送信できません。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:887
msgid "wc.artws.info sent a response that could not be read. Try again later."
msgstr ""
"wc.artws.info から読み取れない応答が返りました。しばらくしてからもう一度お試"
"しください。"

#. translators: %s: date and time
#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:1009
#, php-format
msgid "The check can run once an hour. Try again after %s."
msgstr ""
"診断は 1 時間に 1 回まで実行できます。%s 以降にもう一度お試しください。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:1012
msgid "The check can run once an hour. Try again later."
msgstr ""
"診断は 1 時間に 1 回まで実行できます。しばらくしてからもう一度お試しくださ"
"い。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:1022
msgid ""
"wc.artws.info did not accept the information sent. Update this plugin to the "
"latest version and try again."
msgstr ""
"wc.artws.info が送信した情報を受け付けませんでした。このプラグインを最新版に"
"更新してから、もう一度お試しください。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:1028
msgid "The check of wc.artws.info is not ready yet. Try again later."
msgstr ""
"wc.artws.info の診断の準備ができていません。しばらくしてからもう一度お試しく"
"ださい。"

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code
#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:1036
#, php-format
msgid "wc.artws.info answered with an error (HTTP %d). Try again later."
msgstr ""
"wc.artws.info がエラーを返しました（HTTP %d）。しばらくしてからもう一度お試し"
"ください。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:1070
msgid ""
"Could not connect to wc.artws.info. Make sure this server can connect to it, "
"and try again later."
msgstr ""
"wc.artws.info に接続できませんでした。このサーバーから接続できることを確かめ"
"て、しばらくしてからもう一度お試しください。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:1083
msgid ""
"The free check sends the results of the security check: turn the security "
"check on and wait for its first results."
msgstr ""
"無料診断はセキュリティチェックの結果を送信します。セキュリティチェックをオン"
"にして、最初の結果が出るまでお待ちください。"

#: includes/class-jp4wc-security-scan.php:1096
msgid ""
"Another request to wc.artws.info is running. Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"wc.artws.info への別の要求を実行中です。数分後にもう一度お試しください。"
